WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:26.131
We are here to learn, which means that we
might have to admit that we don't know everything.

00:00:26.131 --> 00:00:32.430
We can't just try to justify our own beliefs,
but, instead, we must humble ourselves and

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:38.200
be willing to hear other people out, willing
to be wrong, willing to swallow our pride

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.050
and shift our views.

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:45.410
Because being a Hillsdalian means doing whatever
it takes to pursue truth.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:50.510
The best gift that you can give to this institution
and certainly the best gift that you can give

00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:55.870
any person is your unreserved, enthusiastic,
and joyful self.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:30.280
You can learn nothing at any moment when you
are not working, and just as bad, you cannot

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:33.260
help others if you do not prepare.

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:37.000
That's why you have been warned that this
not easy.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:40.420
We here, the faculty over there, we love you.

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:41.420
Why?

00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:43.800
It's so much fun to watch you.

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:47.800
Everything you do you're doing for the first
time, including this and this day.

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:55.300
I welcome you with the words that I have said
now 17 times as the last words I say at this

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:57.880
ceremony: get your boots on.

00:01:57.880 --> 00:01:59.260
Welcome.

